Package: rSketchLS
Type: Package
Title: Randomized Sketching for Least Squares
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person(given = "Thesis", family = "Author", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "author@example.com")
Description: Experimental implementations of randomized sketching methods for
    overdetermined least-squares problems. The package is intended as a thesis
    workbench for comparing sketch types, studying mixed-precision variants,
    and benchmarking accuracy against dense reference solvers.
